from pathlib import Path
import json
p=Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent
o=p/'listening-v2'
html=r'''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Review of reviews · three listening pitches</title><style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;color:#183f34;background:#f4f0e5;font:16px/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif}main{max-width:1380px;margin:auto;padding:28px 30px 70px}header{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}h1{font:36px/1.1 Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 10px}p{margin:10px 0}.eyebrow{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#6c725d}.sub{font-size:14px;color:#546a5f;max-width:800px}.options{display:flex;gap:10px;margin:22px 0 12px;flex-wrap:wrap}button,select{font:inherit;color:inherit;background:#fffdf5;border:1px solid #afbaaa;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 15px}button{cursor:pointer}button[aria-pressed=true]{background:#193f34;color:#fff8e4;border-color:#193f34}button:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:default}button:focus-visible,a:focus-visible,select:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #ba731e;outline-offset:3px}.reason{max-width:980px;font-size:14px;min-height:42px}.frame{position:relative;aspect-ratio:1672/941;background:#253f32;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}.hero{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;object-fit:cover}.board{position:absolute;top:2%;left:21.7%;width:62.7%;height:89.2%;background:#f5efdc;padding:18px 22px;border:1px solid #d1c2a0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}.frame.opening .board{display:none}.board h2{font:clamp(19px,2.15vw,32px)/1.12 Georgia,serif;margin:0}.mini{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.85fr repeat(11,1fr);gap:2px;font-size:8px;line-height:1.1}.mini>div{height:12px;padding:2px;background:#d7dbcb;text-align:center;overflow:hidden}.mini .rowlabel{background:transparent;text-align:left;font-size:8px}.mini .col{background:transparent;font-weight:bold;height:24px}.mini .active{background:#ebba38;color:#173d31}.mini .marked{font-weight:bold}.legend{font-size:10px;line-height:1.3;color:#566151}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;flex:1;min-height:0}.card{padding:12px 14px;background:#fffaf0;border-top:4px solid #c79124;border-radius:2px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}.card small{font-size:11px;color:#55685c}.card strong{font:clamp(18px,1.8vw,27px)/1.13 Georgia,serif;display:block;margin-top:8px}.state{font-size:12px;border-top:1px solid #c8c5ae;padding-top:7px;font-weight:650}.transport{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:16px 0}audio{flex:1;min-width:200px}#count{white-space:nowrap;font-size:13px}.words{font:24px/1.5 Georgia,serif;max-width:1040px;margin:20px 0}.sources{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.sources a{font-size:13px;color:#164d3e;background:#e3e8d9;border-radius:5px;padding:7px 10px;text-decoration:none}.sources a:hover{text-decoration:underline}.notes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:22px;margin-top:20px;font-size:13px;color:#4a6557}.notes h3{margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#173f32}.status{font-size:12px;color:#876428}.progress{display:flex;gap:5px;margin:13px 0}.progress button{padding:0;height:5px;flex:1;border:0;background:#cbd3c3;border-radius:0}.progress button.current{background:#956822}details{margin-top:24px;border-top:1px solid #bec7b6;padding-top:16px}summary{cursor:pointer}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:12px;min-width:940px}td,th{padding:9px;border:1px solid #cad1bf;text-align:left}th{background:#e3e9da}td.empty{color:#7c8578}a{color:#155840}.tablewrap{overflow-x:auto;margin:15px 0}#error{color:#a63023}footer{font-size:12px;color:#576c5e;margin-top:30px}@media(min-width:1500px){.mini>div{height:17px}.mini .col{height:28px}}@media(max-width:900px){main{padding:18px 14px}.frame{aspect-ratio:auto;overflow:visible;background:transparent}.hero{border-radius:10px}.board{position:relative;top:auto;left:auto;width:100%;height:auto;min-height:410px;padding:18px;border-radius:8px}.board h2{font-size:25px}.card strong{font-size:23px}.mini>div{height:15px}.transport{flex-wrap:wrap}audio{order:5;flex-basis:100%}.words{font-size:22px}.notes{grid-template-columns:1fr}h1{font-size:29px}header{display:block}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){.card{animation:appear .25s ease-out}@keyframes appear{from{opacity:.5;transform:translateY(3px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}}
</style><main><header><div><div class="eyebrow">Review Pirate · editorial review point</div><h1>Three ways through the evidence</h1><p class="sub">One scene, one playable narration clip. Compare the complete journeys. The board and otter are reference stills; this is a listening pitch, not a finished video.</p></div><a href="../STORY_OPTIONS.md">Read the reasoning ↗</a></header><nav class="options" aria-label="Story options"></nav><p id="reason" class="reason"></p><div class="toolbar"><label for="scene">Scene </label><select id="scene"></select> <span id="runtime" class="status"></span></div><div class="progress" aria-label="Scene progress"></div><div id="frame" class="frame"><img class="hero" src="../assets/thumbnail-eight-picks-v2.png" alt="Approved otter and house direction: a robot vacuum beside a reviewer-by-product comparison board"><section class="board" aria-label="Evidence highlighted in this scene"><div class="eyebrow" id="kicker"></div><h2 id="heading"></h2><div class="mini" id="mini" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="legend">Map retained for orientation · amber cells = this beat’s evidence · other marks retained.</div><div class="cards" id="cards"></div><div class="state" id="state"></div></section></div><div class="transport"><button id="prev">← Previous</button><span id="count"></span><audio id="audio" controls preload="metadata"></audio><button id="next">Next →</button><button id="playall" aria-pressed="false">Play whole option</button></div><p id="error" hidden role="alert">Audio did not load. Start the local preview server and reload this page.</p><p id="words" class="words"></p><div id="sources" class="sources" aria-label="Original sources for this scene"></div><div class="notes"><section><h3>Intended motion / otter action</h3><p id="staging"></p></section><section><h3>Persistent board change</h3><p id="state-note"></p><p>No unexamined product is marked inferior. The first grid shows selected lead picks; the expanded map also includes category awards and owner evidence.</p></section></div><details><summary>Explore the underlying matrix</summary><p>Native source scores and awards. Their scales are not comparable. A blank is unextracted, not a negative review. Two rows from one publisher are not two independent votes.</p><div class="tablewrap" id="fullmatrix"></div><p id="legend"></p><p><a href="../research/REVIEW_OF_REVIEWS_RESET.md">Eight-source baseline</a> · <a href="../research/SOURCE_QUALITY_PASS.md">Review-quality and video inspection</a> · <a href="../research/NEW_FINDINGS_AND_CHALLENGES.md">Findings and challenges</a> · <a href="../research/LANDSCAPE_SCOPE.md">Scope and honest counts</a></p></details><details><summary>What this pitch does and does not establish</summary><p>The preferred option identifies two useful review paths, not a verified market-wide two-product shortlist. Broader catalogue coverage, matched price history, deeper owner sampling and further video inspection remain open. The Prime offer in option C was observed September 26, 2026 and must be refreshed.</p><p>Neutral local Kokoro af_heart narration. It is not the assistant’s live voice or the final otter voice. No paid media credits used. Generated illustrations do not show physical testing performed by us. Real reviewer thumbnails and exact-model photo axes remain a production refinement.</p></details><footer>Source observations → source verdicts → our stated synthesis. Audio stops between scenes by default. <a href="../EXECUTION_BRIEF.md">Approved execution brief</a></footer></main><script>
const scenes=SCENES,options=OPTIONS,matrix=MATRIX;const $=id=>document.getElementById(id),esc=s=>String(s).replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));let option='B',index=0,continuous=false;const audio=$('audio');const subset=()=>scenes.filter(s=>s.option===option);
document.querySelector('.options').innerHTML=options.map(o=>`<button data-option="${o.id}" aria-pressed="false">${o.id} · ${esc(o.title)}</button>`).join('');document.querySelectorAll('[data-option]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>choose(b.dataset.option));
function choose(id){option=id;index=0;continuous=false;$('playall').setAttribute('aria-pressed','false');document.querySelectorAll('[data-option]').forEach(b=>b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',b.dataset.option===id));const o=options.find(o=>o.id===id);$('reason').textContent=o.recommendation+'. '+o.reason;$('scene').innerHTML=subset().map((s,i)=>`<option value="${i}">${s.id} · ${esc(s.title)}</option>`).join('');$('runtime').textContent=Math.round(subset().reduce((a,s)=>a+(s.duration||0),0))+' seconds total narration';show(0)}
function show(i){audio.pause();index=i;const list=subset(),s=list[i];$('scene').value=i;$('frame').className='frame'+(s.opening?' opening':'');$('kicker').textContent=s.id+' · evidence focus';$('heading').textContent=s.title;$('state').textContent=s.state;$('state-note').textContent=s.state;$('words').textContent=s.spoken;$('staging').textContent=s.staging;$('cards').innerHTML=s.cards.map(c=>`<div class="card"><small>${esc(c[0])}</small><strong>${esc(c[1])}</strong></div>`).join('');$('mini').innerHTML='<div></div>'+matrix.columns.map((c,j)=>`<div class="col ${s.columns.includes(j)?'active':''}">${esc(c)}</div>`).join('')+matrix.rows.map((r,ri)=>`<div class="rowlabel">${esc(r.name.split(' · ')[0])}</div>`+matrix.columns.map((c,j)=>`<div class="${s.columns.includes(j)&&s.rows.includes(ri)?'active ':''}${r.cells[j]?'marked':''}">${r.cells[j]?'●':''}</div>`).join('')).join('');$('sources').innerHTML=(s.sources.length?s.sources:[{label:'Eight-source lead-pick audit',url:'../research/REVIEW_OF_REVIEWS_RESET.md'}]).map(r=>`<a href="${esc(r.url)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">${esc(r.label)} ↗</a>`).join('');audio.src=s.audio;audio.setAttribute('aria-label','Narration '+s.id+' '+s.title);$('count').textContent=`${i+1} / ${list.length} · ${s.duration||'?'}s`;$('prev').disabled=i===0;$('next').disabled=i===list.length-1;$('error').hidden=true;document.querySelector('.progress').innerHTML=list.map((v,j)=>`<button class="${j===i?'current':''}" aria-label="Go to scene ${v.id}" data-scene="${j}"></button>`).join('');document.querySelectorAll('[data-scene]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{continuous=false;show(Number(b.dataset.scene))})}
$('scene').onchange=()=>{continuous=false;show(Number($('scene').value))};$('prev').onclick=()=>show(index-1);$('next').onclick=()=>show(index+1);$('playall').onclick=()=>{continuous=!continuous;$('playall').setAttribute('aria-pressed',continuous);if(continuous)audio.play().catch(()=>{$('error').hidden=false});else audio.pause()};audio.onended=()=>{if(continuous&&index<subset().length-1){show(index+1);audio.play().catch(()=>{$('error').hidden=false})}else{continuous=false;$('playall').setAttribute('aria-pressed','false')}};audio.onerror=()=>{$('error').hidden=false};$('legend').textContent=matrix.legend;$('fullmatrix').innerHTML='<table><thead><tr><th>Source record</th>'+matrix.columns.map(c=>`<th>${esc(c)}</th>`).join('')+'</tr></thead><tbody>'+matrix.rows.map(r=>'<tr><th>'+esc(r.name)+'</th>'+matrix.columns.map((c,j)=>`<td class="${r.cells[j]?'':'empty'}">${esc(r.cells[j]||'—')}</td>`).join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</tbody></table>';choose('B');
</script></html>'''
for name,file in [('SCENES','scenes.json'),('OPTIONS','options.json'),('MATRIX','matrix.json')]:html=html.replace('='+name,'='+json.dumps(json.loads((o/file).read_text())).replace('</','<\\/'))
(o/'index.html').write_text(html)
g=p/'.gitignore';s=g.read_text();g.write_text(s+('listening-v2/audio/\n' if 'listening-v2/audio/' not in s else ''))
(o/'README.md').write_text('''# Listening comparison, version 2

Three complete options, with one scene and neutral narration clip at a time. `index.html` is built from `scenes.json`, `options.json` and `matrix.json`. Generated audio and reference images remain local and are not committed.

From the pitch directory run `python3 -m http.server 8771 --bind 127.0.0.1`, then open http://127.0.0.1:8771/listening-v2/ .

Audio generation: the existing Kokoro environment and local models are reused by `make_audio.py`; set `KOKORO_MODEL_DIR` to the model directory. Local setup is described in the preceding listening folder. No paid credits.

This is an editorial storyboard. It is not a static-slideshow video production proposal. Real motion, custom acting and source-image axes remain unproduced.
''')
